Adjacent block openers in an attached run stay separate

```
- x
+
> q
+
> q
.
<ul>
  <li>x
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- x
+
| a |
|---|
| b |
+
| a |
|---|
| b |
.
<ul>
  <li>x
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>a</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>a</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
```
